### Add Vitals
POST http://localhost:8080/api/vitals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "patient-001",
  "heartRate": 78,
  "systolicBP": 120,
  "diastolicBP": 80,
  "temperature": 36.8,
  "oxygenSaturation": 98,
  "recordedAt": "2026-09-10T16:45:00"
}

### Get Patient Vitals
GET http://localhost:8080/api/vitals/patient/patient-001

### Create Vitals
POST http://localhost:8080/api/vitals
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "patient-001",
  "heartRate": 78,
  "systolicBP": 120,
  "diastolicBP": 80,
  "temperature": 36.8,
  "oxygenSaturation": 98,
  "recordedAt": "2026-09-10T20:15:00"
}

### Get Patient with Consent Check
GET http://localhost:8080/api/patients/patient-001
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=


### Valid FHIR Resource
POST http://localhost:8080/api/fhir
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resourceType": "Patient",
  "id": "patient-002",
  "name": [
    {
      "use": "official",
      "family": "Smith",
      "given": ["Robert"]
    }
  ],
  "gender": "male",
  "birthDate": "1988-07-20"
}

### Invalid FHIR Resource - Missing resourceType
POST http://localhost:8080/api/fhir
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "patient-003",
  "name": [
    {
      "family": "Test",
      "given": ["Patient"]
    }
  ],
  "gender": "male"
}

### Valid Vitals
POST http://localhost:8080/api/vitals
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "patient-001",
  "heartRate": 78,
  "systolicBP": 120,
  "diastolicBP": 80,
  "temperature": 36.8,
  "oxygenSaturation": 98,
  "recordedAt": "2026-09-10T22:15:00"
}

### Invalid Vitals
POST http://localhost:8080/api/vitals
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "patient-001",
  "heartRate": -50,
  "systolicBP": 120,
  "diastolicBP": 80,
  "temperature": 36.8,
  "oxygenSaturation": 98,
  "recordedAt": "2026-09-10T22:20:00"
}

### Get Patient - Audit Test
GET http://localhost:8080/api/patients/patient-001
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=


### Doctor - Get Patient
GET http://localhost:8080/api/patients/patient-001
Authorization: Basic ZG9jdG9yOmRvY3RvcjEyMw==


### Doctor - Try Doctor Management
GET http://localhost:8080/api/doctors
Authorization: Basic ZG9jdG9yOmRvY3RvcjEyMw==


### Complete Health Twin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/health-twins
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "patient-001",
  "patientName": "John Doe",
  "age": 35,
  "gender": "Male",
  "conditions": ["Hypertension"],
  "medications": ["Amlodipine"]
}

### Incomplete Health Twin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/health-twins
Authorization: Basic YWRtaW46YWRtaW4xMjM=
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "patient-003",
  "patientName": "Test Patient",
  "age": 40,
  "conditions": ["Diabetes"],
  "medications": ["Metformin"]
}